      "id": "claim_7f474621f1724bb28f34e2855b92d969",
      "statement": "`TimeoutLangSmithSandbox` enforces a client deadline around a nonblocking LangSmith command, returns distinct exit-124 responses for server and client timeout, best-effort kills client-expired commands, and falls back to base execution on supported WebSocket failures.",
